VALUES ('54b3cef3-8306-4f3e-af53-9ca332954d37', 'f19419db-13d2-4cc7-a07e-832ede51e4f0', 'multiple_choice', E'以下のコードを実行した場合、出力される内容を答えよ。\n\n```java\npublic class CauseChain {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        try {\n            level1();\n        } catch (RuntimeException e) {\n            System.out.println(e.getMessage());\n            System.out.println(e.getCause().getMessage());\n            System.out.println(e.getCause().getCause().getMessage());\n        }\n    }\n\n    static void level1() {\n        try {\n            level2();\n        } catch (RuntimeException e) {\n            throw new RuntimeException("L1", e);\n        }\n    }\n\n    static void level2() {\n        try {\n            level3();\n        } catch (RuntimeException e) {\n            throw new RuntimeException("L2", e);\n        }\n    }\n\n    static void level3() {\n        throw new RuntimeException("L3");\n    }\n}\n```', E'level3()でRuntimeException("L3")が発生し、level2()で"L2"に変換（causeにL3）、level1()で"L1"に変換（causeにL2）される。main()でe.getMessage()→"L1"、e.getCause().getMessage()→"L2"、e.getCause().getCause().getMessage()→"L3"が出力される。(Evidence: E2, E3)', 10, 6, 'medium')
